%% Round-2 offer (app_round2_offer)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> R2Pending : Block approved with Waitlisted Applications (FR-APP-07)
  R2Pending --> Accepted : student picks one held Bed (FR-APP-07)
  R2Pending --> Declined : student declines (FR-APP-07)
  R2Pending --> R2Expired : no answer in time (job, FR-APP-07)
  R2Pending --> Withdrawn : the Application ends
  R2Pending : Pending
  R2Expired : Expired
